Package: anotherSAS7bdat
Title: Read SAS Data in Continuous Memory-Bounded Chunks
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("anotherSAS7bdat", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: Reads SAS 'sas7bdat' files through a persistent native reader.
    Processes configurable chunks without reopening the input or restarting
    the parser between chunks. Supports uncompressed, run-length encoded,
    and Ross Data Compression data through the bundled 'ReadStat' library.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), haven
SystemRequirements: C++17, POSIX threads, iconv
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
